# Why a Custom CNN 
 We chose to build our CNN from scratch rather than 
 using a pre-trained model like MobileNetV2 or ResNet50. 
 ## Why we built from scratch 
 - The assignment allows either a custom CNN or transfer learning. 
 - Building from scratch helps us understand every layer. 
 - Our dataset is small (600 images), so we wanted full 
 control over the architecture. 
 ## Trade-offs 
 - A custom CNN takes longer to tune
- With only 600 images, it is harder to generalize. 
 - Transfer learning would likely give better accuracy 
 on this small dataset. 

